WEBVTT

10:31.539 --> 10:33.748
what is in those presents.

10:37.545 --> 10:40.463
Okay, who's hungry?

10:41.299 --> 10:42.507
Here come the chips!

10:42.592 --> 10:45.051
I've got Cool Ranch
and barbecue!

10:45.595 --> 10:47.095
What in the world... Oh!

10:47.638 --> 10:50.599
I thought I told him
to pick these up.

10:50.892 --> 10:53.310
Shouldn't they be there by now?
What's taking them so long?

10:53.394 --> 10:56.479
Hey, these guys are professionals.
They're the best.

10:57.148 --> 10:59.524
Come on!
They're not lying down on the job.
